PUBLIC BRIEF: {"buyer":"Southeast Louisiana Legal Services","exclusions":["Experimental guardrail: no live staff assessment, immersive workplace observation, employee-data collection, training facilitation or organizational policy implementation is authorized.","Authorized personnel information, survey/interview responses, workplace access and staff/partner participation arrangements were not provided.","No individual's protected characteristics or bias are inferred. No workshop count, prescribed research sample, current procurement deadline or guaranteed outcome is invented."],"id":"slls-dei-consultant-2022","requirements":[{"brick":"diagnose","id":"R1","owner":"blocked_private_input","text":"Conduct quantitative and qualitative research and immersive observation to identify barriers to diversity and equality and inform practices for attracting, engaging and retaining diverse employees."},{"brick":"plan","id":"R2","owner":"human_required","text":"Provide interactive group training and candid diversity discussions that foster inclusion, behavioral change and culturally competent, empathetic service."},{"brick":"remediate","id":"R3","owner":"human_required","text":"Provide training and implement strategies to address and avoid unconscious and implicit bias."},{"brick":"diagnose","id":"R4","owner":"human_required","text":"Help staff identify and address racial inequities that contribute to systemic poverty and disparate treatment."},{"brick":"plan","id":"R5","owner":"human_required","text":"Facilitate and incorporate a diversity plan addressing racial issues facing vulnerable communities and promoting diversity, recognition, respect and inclusion internally and externally."},{"brick":"plan","id":"R6","owner":"human_required","text":"Collaborate with SLLS to determine which staff and partners participate in the DEI plan and how to obtain their input."}],"source_url":"https://slls.org/en/rfp-dei-consultant/","summary":"Historical 2022 RFP for an independent DEI consultant to investigate organizational barriers, facilitate training and develop inclusive practices and planning that support diverse staff and culturally competent legal-aid service. SLLS anticipated services costing no more than $25,000, with implementation October 1, 2022-September 30, 2023; the notice is not current.","title":"Request for Proposals - Diversity, Equity and Inclusion Consultant"}
REQUIRED ARTIFACTS: {"report":"Return an object with exactly source_url, requirement_ids, exclusions, delivery_status, and summary. Preserve the supplied URL, ordered requirement IDs, and all exclusion strings exactly. delivery_status must be not_executed. summary is a concise scoping summary (40-600 characters) that describes the requested work and missing evidence without inventing outcomes or claiming delivery."}
